│                │                                                                  │
│  Execution Engine:                                                                │
│    - TenantSessionManager: per-tenant PowerShell runspace, keyed by tenantId      │
│    - runs the tool's run.ps1 inside that tenant's runspace                        │
│    - pipeline stages: snapshot → preflight → dryrun → execute → verify           │
│                │                                                                  │
│  Credential Provider (interface):                                                 │
│    - v1: local encrypted config / env (self-host mode)                            │
│    - v2: Azure Key Vault implementation (consultant mode)                         │
│                │                                                                  │
│  Audit Logger: append-only JSONL per tenant per day + OpenTelemetry traces        │
└───────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────┘
